ositions and show the villagers no mercy!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962560/extras/9aedd8ec4c85508b964352b2ee314dfc.poster.avif?t=1662129644\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962560/extras/9aedd8ec4c85508b964352b2ee314dfc.webm?t=1662129644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962560/extras/9aedd8ec4c85508b964352b2ee314dfc.mp4?t=1662129644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Raze and Destroy</h2>Raze Villages and Conquer the world through the power of your ever-growing army, leaving a trail of destruction beneath!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962560/extras/7832116b93affbd0fd5b653e1d943783.poster.avif?t=1662129644\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962560/extras/7832116b93affbd0fd5b653e1d943783.webm?t=1662129644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962560/extras/7832116b93affbd0fd5b653e1d943783.mp4?t=1662129644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collects Their Souls</h2>Reap the souls of mortals to increase your might and use them to power up your armies and your skills.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962560/extras/f634f888304524de978d527db289f187.poster.avif?t=1662129644\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962560/extras/f634f888304524de978d527db289f187.webm?t=1662129644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962560/extras/f634f888304524de978d527db289f187.mp4?t=1662129644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rise again and get stronger</h2>After you die, choose what to upgrade and find the gameplay style that suits your hunger for power!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962560/extras/edc38f8569ad320ea2ce2d35e872c481.poster.avif?t=1662129644\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962560/extras/edc38f8569ad320ea2ce2d35e872c481.webm?t=1662129644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962560/extras/edc38f8569ad320ea2ce2d35e872c481.mp4?t=1662129644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
